---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Strugen"
  description="About Jhonatan Serna, researcher, consultant, and founder. Writing about technology, finance, philosophy, and existence."
>
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-20 font-serif">

    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-s-muted text-xs mb-10 font-sans">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-s-emerald transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-s-muted">About</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-s-text leading-tight mb-4">
        About Jhonatan Serna
      </h1>
      <p class="text-s-muted text-lg italic leading-relaxed">
        Researcher, consultant, and founder.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider mb-10"></div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose-s text-[18px] leading-relaxed">

      <h2>The Short Version</h2>
      <p>
        I studied physics. I worked in financial services as an IT management consultant, product owner, and business analyst. I spent years founding and administering software enterprises in Sweden and Estonia.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today, my primary mission is leading the <a href="https://centerforsentience.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Center for Sentience</a>, where we mathematically model and build simulation blueprints of positive valence and information routing in digital and biological minds.
      </p>
      <p>
        This archive is a personal log. I write to think clearly, to make sense of what I learn, and to leave something behind. I have less than 100 years on this planet, probably much less, and I want to spend that time exploring the deepest questions of existence, mind, and reality.
      </p>

      <h2>What I Think About</h2>
      <p>
        My interests don't fit neatly into standard academic or corporate boxes. These notes and essays trace the intersections between:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Valence & AI Welfare:</strong> How does subjective experience (pleasure, pain, well-being) manifest computationally in network topologies?</li>
        <li><strong>Global Workspace Theory & IIT:</strong> Spatially-constrained multi-layer network modeling to understand information broadcasting and phenomenal integration.</li>
        <li><strong>Personal Contemplation:</strong> Non-reactive cognitive algorithms (equanimity), Jhana meditation mechanics, and dealing with the constraints of comfort.</li>
        <li><strong>Physics:</strong> The geometric structure of physical and representational state spaces.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why "Strugen"?</h2>
      <p>
        It is a professional and personal moniker I have used for over a decade. It does not carry a specific translation; it is simply my digital handle. You can find me as <code>strugen</code> or <code>strugen_eth</code> across various networks.
      </p>

      <h2>The Other Blog</h2>
      <p>
        I also maintain <a href="https://www.digitalpsychedelics.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digital Psychedelics</a>, which focuses specifically on the physical substrates of time, consciousness, and extreme somatic states. This blog (strugen.com) is broader, more personal, and covers general reflections.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        If something I've written resonates with you, or if you would like to discuss collaboration at the Center, please reach out directly. You can email me at <a href="mailto:strugen@proton.me">strugen@proton.me</a> or use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="section-divider my-10"></div>

    <!-- Simple Structured Meta (Carlsmith style) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-sans text-xs pt-4">
      <div class="p-4 border border-s-border bg-s-dark/30 rounded-sm">
        <p class="text-s-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-bold">Scientific Core</p>
        <p class="text-s-text font-medium">Physics & Neural Networks</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 border border-s-border bg-s-dark/30 rounded-sm">
        <p class="text-s-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-bold">Current Base</p>
        <p class="text-s-text font-medium">Zürich, Switzerland</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 border border-s-border bg-s-dark/30 rounded-sm">
        <p class="text-s-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-bold">Research Lab</p>
        <a href="https://centerforsentience.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-s-emerald font-medium underline">centerforsentience.org</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>
